Password Policy Validation Engine
Aim: Validate passwords using minimum length, character categories, repeated characters, and prohibited substrings.
Algorithm
1. Start.
2. Enter a password.
3. Check whether it has at least 8 characters.
4. Check for uppercase, lowercase, digit, and special characters.
5. Check whether any character repeats three or more times consecutively.
6. Check for a prohibited substring such as password.
7. Display each failed condition.
8. If no conditions fail, display “Password is valid.”
9. Stop.
